AltoConvexCreditLineMarket::pause()
├── when caller lacks the requested pauser role
│   └── it should revert with Unauthorized without changing pause or accounting state
├── when enabling PAUSE_TYPE
│   ├── it should accrue interest before marking the market paused
│   ├── it should add accrued interest to active debt and claimableFeesAssets but not badDebtAssets
│   ├── it should emit AccrueInterest before Paused
│   └── when IRM accrual fails
│       └── it should propagate the failure and remain unpaused atomically
├── when disabling PAUSE_TYPE
│   ├── it should notify the IRM before marking the market unpaused
│   ├── it should restart interest accrual from the unpause timestamp
│   └── when the IRM notification fails
│       └── it should propagate the failure and remain paused atomically
├── when enabling or disabling FROZEN_TYPE
│   ├── it should update only the frozen state
│   └── it should not accrue interest or notify the IRM pause hook
└── when requested state equals current state
    ├── it should revert with StateNotChanged
    └── it should roll back any PAUSE_TYPE hook effects atomically
